Description: Scalable I/O Library for Parallel Access to Task-Local Files (intel + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 SIONlib is a library for writing and reading binary data to/from several
 thousands of processors into one or a small number of physical files.
 Built with the intel compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
